      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "主链路",
      "items": [
        "短码 GET /:code 由 shortCodeDispatch 中间件拦截（short_code_dispatch.go）",
        "缓存优先，未命中回源 short_links 并回写 24h（shortlink_service.go）"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "orange",
      "title": "分流与边界",
      "items": [
        "EvaluateRedirect 拦截风险链接；路由按国家/设备/语言，A/B 按 TrafficSplit（sessionID=hash(IP+UA)）",
        "统计由 goroutine 异步写入；密码/410/403/防红为控制器分支；/preview/:code 不计统计"
      ]
